libraries.plan_schema:
{
  "toolbar_buttons": ["file", "dir", "del", "imp", "exp", "gen", "filter"],
  "context_menu_items": {
    "entry": ["add_file", "add_dir", "delete", "copy", "paste", "cut", "rename"],
    "panel": ["add_file", "add_dir", "delete", "copy", "paste"]
  },
  "keyboard_shortcuts": {
    "copy": true,
    "paste": true,
    "cut": true,
    "add_file": true,
    "add_dir": true,
    "delete": true
  },
  "features": {
    "drag_drop": true,
    "auto_save": true,
    "resizer": true,
    "filter": true
  },
  "initial_entries": [{"type": "file", "name": "example.txt", "content": "Hello"}, {"type": "dir", "name": "folder", "children": []}]
}
All fields optional. Booleans enable/disable features. Arrays control which UI elements appear. initial_entries seeds the tree.

Plan is a pure-data JSON object that configures the generated survey site. It does not contain code or HTML.

Root object:
- title: string (default: "Survey") — Survey title displayed on the page and used in export.
- formSelector: string (default: "#survey-form") — CSS selector for the form; index.html includes this form id by default.
- contents: { enabled?: boolean } (default: {enabled:true}) — Toggle the right-side contents panel.
- questions: array of questionSpec (default: []) — Ordered list of questions to build. Each questionSpec is:
  - kind: string — One of: "question", "single", "multi", "open", "rating", "ranking", "nps", "likert", "data".
  - title: string — Title text (without numeric index prefix).
  - name: string — Unique name (also used as fieldset id). For kind="data", name should reflect the data type (e.g., "data-url").
  - position?: "append" | "prepend" (default: "append") — Where to insert relative to existing questions.
  - required?: boolean (default: false) — Initial required state (if supported by the kind).
  - Additional per-kind fields:
    - kind="question": none (base question, no inputs).
    - kind="single": { options: string[], isSelectMode?: boolean, isShuffleMode?: boolean }
    - kind="multi": { options: string[], isShuffleMode?: boolean }
    - kind="open": { isMultilines: boolean, minLength?: number }
    - kind="rating": { starCount?: number }
    - kind="ranking": { options: string[], isShuffleMode?: boolean }
    - kind="nps": {} (0-10 scale)
    - kind="likert": { options: string[], statements: string[] }
    - kind="data": { dataType: "url"|"tel"|"email"|"date"|"number" }

Runtime behavior from plan:
- Questions are created in order. For each item, Survey uses prependQuestion or appendQuestion according to position, then renumbers question titles so the topmost is index 1.
- Required, isSelectMode, isShuffleMode, and minLength are applied after construction (consistent with constructor parameter constraints).
- Contents panel is created/updated if contents.enabled is true.

Export format (saved to localStorage.data when .export is clicked):
{ title: string, questions: QuestionJSON[] }
where each QuestionJSON includes all constructor and config properties for its type, e.g.:
- single: { kind:"single", title, name, options, required, isShuffleMode, isSelectMode }
- open: { kind:"open", title, name, isMultilines, minLength, required }
- rating: { kind:"rating", title, name, starCount, required }
- ranking: { kind:"ranking", title, name, options, isShuffleMode }
- nps: { kind:"nps", title, name, required }
- likert: { kind:"likert", title, name, options, statements, required }
- data: { kind:"data", title, name, dataType, required }
- multi: { kind:"multi", title, name, options, required, isShuffleMode }
- question: { kind:"question", title, name, required }
